nife-edge-presiden","published":"2026-10-24","id":"n2"},{"cat":"World","title":"Nearly 1,000 arrested as cost-of-living protests sweep France","summary":"More than 400,000 people marched across France on Saturday, with about 70,000 security personnel deployed and clashes in Paris, Marseille, Lyon and other cities. Protests also hit Italy, Spain and Albania.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/25/almost-1000-arrests-across-france-as-protesters-clashed-with-police","published":"2026-10-25","id":"n3"},{"cat":"Business","title":"Big Tech earnings and Fed meeting set to test shaky AI rally","summary":"Alphabet, Microsoft and Amazon report this week alongside about a third of S&P 500 firms, and the Fed meets Wednesday. Stocks ended Friday lower, with the Dow down 1.23% to 52,215 and the S&P 500 off 0.52%.","source":"Reuters via Yahoo Finance","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/earnings-flood-fed-meeting-pose-100557196.html","published":"2026-10-23","id":"n4"},{"cat":"Major","title":"Justice Department sues to block Alaska Senate certification","summary":"The DOJ filed suit to stop Alaska from certifying its Senate result if Republican incumbent Dan Sullivan loses, citing a second Republican candidate with the same name on the ballot. Democrat Mary Peltola called the lawsuit corrupt.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12119991/trumps-threat-alaska-senate-illigitimate-expert/","published":"2026-10-24","id":"n5"},{"cat":"AI","title":"U.S. and China AI blocs force countries to pick sides","summary":"Countries such as Kazakhstan have joined both the U.S.-led Pax Silica group and China's World AI Cooperation Organization. China has funded AI projects in at least 77 lower-income countries, per AidData.","source":"Associated Press","url":"https://www.clickorlando.com/business/2026/10/25/as-the-us-and-china-form-ai-blocs-countries-are-increasingly-torn-between-them/","published":"2026-10-25","id":"n6"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"First Nations leaders set priorities for Monday meeting with Carney","summary":"First Nations leaders meet PM Mark Carney and the premiers in Ottawa on Oct. 26, the first such gathering in over two decades. A sovereign wealth fund and repeal of fast-track project legislation are among their asks.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12119837/first-nations-leaders-voice-priorities-ahead-of-ottawa-meeting/","published":"2026-10-24","id":"n7"},{"cat":"Business","title":"Brent crude tops $116 on Middle East escalation fears","summary":"Brent settled at $116.72 a barrel Friday, a six-month high and third straight weekly gain, while WTI closed just above $103. U.S. gasoline averages $4.29 a gallon, $1.22 above a year ago.","source":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/article/brent-crude-tops-116-as-traders-price-in-middle-east-escalation-192101547.html","published":"2026-10-23","id":"n8"},{"cat":"World","title":"Israel heads to the polls as West Bank violence escalates","summary":"Israelis vote this week in an election seen as a test for Netanyahu, challenged by former army chief Gadi Eisenkot. Israel ordered a West Bank lockdown after deadly attacks, displacing over 1,000 residents in Hebron.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12119951/conflict-in-palestine-israel-election/","published":"2026-10-24","id":"n9"},{"cat":"AI","title":"Study: Grok backs Republicans, GPT-6.1 backs Democrats when forced to pick","summary":"Testing nearly 500 U.S. races via API, researchers found Grok 4.7 recommended the Republican 92% of the time and OpenAI's GPT-6.1 Sol picked the Democrat 97% of the time. The models agreed less than 10% of the time.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/24/forced-to-pick-groks-ai-model-chooses-republicans-openais-picks-democrats/","published":"2026-10-24","id":"n10"},{"cat":"World","title":"Serbia holds snap election pitting Vučić camp against student movement","summary":"More than 6.45 million Serbians are eligible to elect 250 lawmakers on Sunday, with 18 lists and 2,418 candidates. Polls diverge and many voters are undecided.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/25/serbia-goes-to-polls-to-choose-between-populist-vucic-and-student-movement","published":"2026-10-25","id":"n11"},{"cat":"World","title":"Russia and Ukraine eye new peace talks in Abu Dhabi","summary":"A fourth round of U.S.-brokered talks is likely in mid-November, though Russia launched a deadly barrage on Kyiv hours after Putin agreed in principle. Russia occupies about 20% of Ukraine.","source":"Associated Press via Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12119807/ukraine-russia-peace-talks-2/","published":"2026-10-24","id":"n12"},{"cat":"Business","title":"Audi to build $4 billion plant in Georgia, its first U.S. factory","summary":"Audi plans a plant near Macon able to build up to 200,000 vehicles a year with about 4,500 jobs, announced at a Trump rally. Full production is targeted for 2031.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/25/audi-heads-to-us-trump-hopes-carmaker-boosts-election-bid","published":"2026-10-25","id":"n13"},{"cat":"AI","title":"Elvis Presley rights holders sue Anthropic over 274 songs","summary":"Authentic Brands Group and Presley rights holders accuse Anthropic of training Claude on 274 copyrighted songs without permission. Reported statutory damages sought total about $41 million.","source":"VICE","url":"https://www.vice.com/en/article/elvis-presley-estate-sues-anthropic-for-stealing-his-music-at-a-scale-never-seen-before-to-train-ai/","published":"2026-10-24","id":"n14"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"Cuba urges Canada to keep opposing U.S. embargo ahead of UN vote","summary":"Cuban diplomats asked Ottawa to back their annual UN motion against the U.S. embargo, set for a vote next week. Canada says its position is under consideration and has pledged $13 million in aid.","source":"The Canadian Press via Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12119801/canada-opposition-us-embargo-cuba/","published":"2026-10-24","id":"n15"},{"cat":"Major","title":"Fire guts Hitler's former Eagle's Nest retreat in Bavaria","summary":"More than 200 responders fought a fire that left the 1938 Kehlsteinhaus fully ablaze Friday night. No injuries were reported and one person was taken into custody.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/24/arrest-made-after-major-fire-breaks-out-at-hitlers-eagles-nest-mountain-retreat-in-bavaria","published":"2026-10-24","id":"n16"},{"cat":"AI","title":"Block unveils Dessa, a human-like voice model that runs on a laptop","summary":"Jack Dorsey's Block released Dessa, a full-duplex voice model trained on a single Nvidia GPU rack that runs locally on high-end MacBooks. It is not public yet while safety researchers test it.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/24/blocks-new-voice-model-sounds-eerily-human/","published":"2026-10-24","id":"n17"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"Medic critically hurt saving soldiers in CFB Wainwright fire","summary":"Cpl. Liam Keane, 23, ran into the fire repeatedly to rescue fellow soldiers and remains in critical condition. Four soldiers died in the Oct. 17 training-exercise fire in Alberta.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12119428/he-ran-into-the-fire-military-medic-critically-injured-saving-fellow-soldiers-in-cfb-wainwright-fire/","published":"2026-10-24","id":"n18"}]}